   "speaker": "Anthony Albanese",
   "party": "Labor",
   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2015-11-23",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Migration Amendment (Mandatory Reporting) Bill 2015 requires all Department of Immigration and Border Protection staff, contractors and subcontractors to report child sexual abuse in detention facilities to the Commissioner of the Australian Border Force, with failure to report an offence. The speaker criticised the government's secrecy and slow processing of asylum claims, and supported moving children and families out of detention."
